[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3582563956","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112711#issuecomment-3582563956","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112711","id":3582563956,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ViZZ0","user":{"login":"Faradax","id":5133378,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMzMzNzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5133378?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faradax","html_url":"https://github.com/Faradax","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faradax/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faradax/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faradax/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faradax/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faradax/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faradax/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faradax/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faradax/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faradax/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-26T17:55:51Z","updated_at":"2025-11-26T17:55:51Z","body":"The tooltip for the property with `PROPERTY_USAGE_NEVER_DUPLICATE` flag reads \"Resource can't be duplicated\". I feel like this is inaccurate in two aspects and doesn't give much information:\r\n\r\n1. Phrasing could be misunderstood as an error message, like \"tried to duplicate, but something went wrong\". In reality, the flag is used intentionally and part of the design of the resource.\r\n2. According to the docs, the flag prevents duplication of the **property**, but the tooltip mentions the **resource**. I assume that in reality, the resource _can_ be duplicated when it's in another property (without the flag).\r\n\r\nI propose something that is clearer in both aspects, like for example:\r\n\r\n- \"Duplication not allowed for this property\"\r\n- \"Property disallows resource duplication\"\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3582563956/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3582746829","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112711#issuecomment-3582746829","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112711","id":3582746829,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VjGDN","user":{"login":"SanNull","id":124409014,"node_id":"U_kgDOB2pUtg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124409014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull","html_url":"https://github.com/SanNull","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-26T18:43:31Z","updated_at":"2025-11-26T18:43:31Z","body":"I agree, I was thinking about what description to add here, and mentioning Resource here wouldn't be good. I think explicitly stating the property flag would be a good solution, maybe something like:\n\n- The flag 'PROPERTY_USAGE_NEVER_DUPLICATE' is set for this property.\n\nOr, if stating the flag's name is not 